<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telco reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telco reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Joseph Bellace downgraded Telco Systems Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate, and kept the long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped two to 8-1/2.</p>
</text>
